    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>LOST ALTR</i> is a solo rogue-lite card game set within the crumbling halls of a forgotten temple. You\u2019ll face a series of Trials\u2014mysterious encounters drawn from an ever-shifting deck. Each completed Trial leads you deeper into the Ruins of ALTR. Use Aspect cards to shape your fate\u2014mysterious forces that grant you powerful advantages, but always at a cost.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built on the foundation of the Scoundrel card mechanics by Zach Gage and Kurt Biegand, a heavily reimagined experience, <i>LOST ALTR\u00a0</i>blends strategy, luck, and lore in a dark, esoteric world. The path forward is never the same. The further you go, the more the ruins remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early Access will evolve with new cards, mechanics, and layers of mystery\u2014shaped by feedback from those brave enough to enter the ALTR.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>LOST ALTR</i> is a solo rogue-lite card game set within the crumbling halls of a forgotten temple. You\u2019ll face a series of Trials\u2014mysterious encounters drawn from an ever-shifting deck. Each completed Trial leads you deeper into the Ruins of ALTR. Use Aspect cards to shape your fate\u2014mysterious forces that grant you powerful advantages, but always at a cost.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built on the foundation of the Scoundrel card mechanics by Zach Gage and Kurt Biegand, a heavily reimagined experience, <i>LOST ALTR\u00a0</i>blends strategy, luck, and lore in a dark, esoteric world. The path forward is never the same. The further you go, the more the ruins remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early Access will evolve with new cards, mechanics, and layers of mystery\u2014shaped by feedback from those brave enough to enter the ALTR.</p>",
    "short_description": "Descend into forgotten ruins and face the Trials. LOST ALTR is a solo rogue-lite card game shaped by shadows, fate, and shifting decks. Harness powerful Aspects. Survive. Move deeper. Each room brings you closer to something... unknowable.",
